lenovo-yoga-c940-14iil (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: depends on convertible-helper, convertible-power and
    grub-large-console, on the Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, SOF audio and Intel graphics
    firmware packages and on iio-sensor-proxy, and installs this laptop's TLP
    settings.  Includes a feature check script.  The fingerprint reader
    (06cb:00be) is unsupported by libfprint and is not made to work.

